   "titulo": "Talk about time",
   "texto": [
    "**Hava nasıl?** = what time does it make? **Hava güzel** = good weather.",
    "**Yağmur yağıyor** = rain (literally, rain falls); **kar yağıyor** = nieva. **Güneşli** means sunny and **bulutlu**, cloudy.",
    "To tell the temperature: **Hava sıcak** (it's hot) or **hava soğuk** (it's cold)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Stations",
   "texto": [
    "**İlkbahar** = spring; **yaz** = summer; **sonbahar** = autumn; **kış** = winter.",
    "**-de/-da** can also indicate the season: **yazın** (in summer), **kışın** (in winter)."
